# Uploaded study materials (SP-V2-003). The default STUDYPAL_STORAGE_DIR is
# `studypal-backend/data/uploads`; `data/` is ignored wholesale so a deployment
# pointing the variable elsewhere under it is covered too. These are real student
# documents — §26 forbids committing them, and this pattern is what makes that
# structural rather than a matter of care with `git add`.
data/

